Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.161 --> 00:00:02.161
correspondent, Sanjay Gupta,

00:00:02.362 --> 00:00:03.362
inside a secret lab where the

00:00:03.997 --> 00:00:04.997
entire mission is fighting the

00:00:05.232 --> 00:00:06.232
threat of fentanyl.

00:00:07.468 --> 00:00:08.468
&gt;&gt; Looking at pictures, even if

00:00:09.803 --> 00:00:10.337
they're not mine.

00:00:10.337 --> 00:00:11.337
Tell a story.

00:00:11.638 --> 00:00:12.638
&gt;&gt; He was such a happy baby.

00:00:14.141 --> 00:00:15.141
Oh, my god.

00:00:15.142 --> 00:00:16.142
So happy all the time.

00:00:16.210 --> 00:00:17.210
&gt;&gt; Is it hard to talk about?

00:00:17.945 --> 00:00:18.945
&gt;&gt; No, I love talking about him.

00:00:19.913 --> 00:00:20.913
I talk about him to anybody that

00:00:21.348 --> 00:00:22.348
will listen.

00:00:22.549 --> 00:00:23.549
I loved seeing him on a hockey

00:00:25.118 --> 00:00:25.419
rink.

00:00:25.419 --> 00:00:26.419
I think that was really, really,

00:00:27.321 --> 00:00:28.321
his happy place where he could

00:00:29.256 --> 00:00:30.256
just sort of be free.

00:00:30.924 --> 00:00:31.924
His friends packed up

00:00:34.194 --> 00:00:34.895
immediately from schools

00:00:34.895 --> 00:00:35.895
wherever they were and came

00:00:36.129 --> 00:00:36.430
over.

00:00:36.430 --> 00:00:37.430
The family started showing up.

00:00:38.899 --> 00:00:39.566
I was just in shock.

00:00:39.566 --> 00:00:40.566
We tried.

00:00:40.901 --> 00:00:41.901
We were doing cpr and not a

00:00:43.337 --> 00:00:43.670
chance.

00:00:43.670 --> 00:00:44.238
He was long gone.

00:00:44.238 --> 00:00:45.238
I don't say he overdosed.

00:00:46.540 --> 00:00:47.540
I say he died from fentanyl

00:00:49.776 --> 00:00:50.143
poisoning.

00:00:50.143 --> 00:00:51.044
Truthfully at the end of the

00:00:51.044 --> 00:00:52.044
day, to me, he was murdered

00:00:53.013 --> 00:00:54.013
because he asked for one thing.

00:00:55.382 --> 00:00:56.183
They gave him something

00:00:56.183 --> 00:00:57.183
different and it took his life.

00:00:58.919 --> 00:00:59.919
&gt;&gt; On a single sad night,

00:01:00.554 --> 00:01:01.554
November 2nd, Dina's son became

00:01:05.626 --> 00:01:06.626
