00:01:08.929 --> 00:01:09.429
overdoses in 2020 alone.

00:01:09.429 --> 00:01:10.429
Much of it driven by fentanyl.

00:01:11.098 --> 00:01:12.098
The problem is there's so many

00:01:12.533 --> 00:01:13.533
