00:01:18.405 --> 00:01:19.405
just to try and keep up.

00:01:20.040 --> 00:01:21.040
We're making our way there now.

00:01:26.580 --> 00:01:27.580
Scott is deputy assistant

00:01:30.350 --> 00:01:30.951
administrator.

