00:01:36.590 --> 00:01:37.590
&gt;&gt; Almost every one of them

00:01:38.091 --> 00:01:39.059
comes back positive.

00:01:39.059 --> 00:01:40.059
&gt;&gt; In 2019, the Dea seized

00:01:41.795 --> 00:01:42.795
roughly 2.2 million pills.

00:01:47.401 --> 00:01:48.201
In 2022, 50.6 million pills.

00:01:48.201 --> 00:01:49.201
At the beginning of the opioid

00:01:50.504 --> 00:01:51.504
epidemic, many of the pills were

00:01:52.539 --> 00:01:52.973
authentic.

00:01:52.973 --> 00:01:53.973
The majority of the pills being

00:01:57.744 --> 00:01:58.744
seized today at the borders, on

00:01:59.413 --> 00:02:00.413
the streets, even in schools --

00:02:00.614 --> 00:02:01.614
&gt;&gt; Over 99% of what we see are

00:02:03.617 --> 00:02:04.617
fake.

