Think about that.

00:02:39.419 --> 00:02:40.419
One bag gives you 400 to 500,000

00:02:42.322 --> 00:02:43.023
lethal doses.

00:02:43.023 --> 00:02:44.023
It's the message the Dea wants

00:02:45.492 --> 00:02:46.492
